# caches / venvs
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv*/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# data symlink (points to the original NAS dataset — not tracked)
/data

# external repos cloned in-tree (Cosmos 3 + cosmos-framework) — pull separately
/repos/

# analysis outputs / galleries (regenerable; large HTML with embedded images)
runs/
*.log

# downloaded model assets (YuNet onnx, Haar cascades — re-download as needed)
/assets/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx

# media
*.gif
*.mp4

.DS_Store

# Baseline checkpoints copied from the yj server (23 GB: pi0.5 300k, GR00T 210k, DP, AutoPhoto,
# UNIC). Weights, not source. `baseline_ckpts/PROVENANCE.md` records where each came from, with
# sha256s, and IS tracked so the provenance survives without the binaries.
baseline_ckpts/*
!baseline_ckpts/PROVENANCE.md
